Provenance
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

TinyMind is an independent implementation. It was designed after studying
the architecture of Needle 2 (package name `cactus-needle`), an open-source
project by Cactus Compute, Inc., licensed under Apache-2.0:

  Source:  https://github.com/cactus-compute/needle
  Weights: https://huggingface.co/Cactus-Compute/needle2

No source code, branding, trademarks, model weights, or artwork from Needle
is included in or reused by TinyMind. TinyMind's public API, module layout,
model file format, class names, and configuration schema were written from
scratch and are deliberately different from Needle's, in line with the
engineering brief this project was built from (see
`docs/architecture/tinymind-design.md`). Where a specific TinyMind design
decision was directly inspired by something in the Needle source tree, that
lineage is called out explicitly in `docs/architecture/needle-analysis.md`
and `docs/architecture/tinymind-design.md`, section by section, rather than
left implicit.

If a future contribution to TinyMind does directly incorporate Needle source
(which Apache-2.0 permits), that file must carry its own top-of-file notice
identifying the origin and preserving Needle's copyright and license notices,
per Apache License 2.0 §4(a)-(c). As of this writing, no such file exists in
this repository.

