Third-party dependencies
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

TinyMind depends on third-party packages declared in `pyproject.toml`, each
under its own license (not reproduced here). Run `pip-licenses` or equivalent
against a concrete installed environment to generate a full dependency
license report before redistribution.
